  copy: "M8 8V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3M4 9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V9Z",
